:I don't want to start experimenting, so I would appreciate any pointers.
     You can dip potions in water to dilute them, but there's a more
effective way.  Have you ever enscribed with a wand over a handwritten
enscription and gotten "The engraving disappears!"  Have you ever
decided to test the wand on yourself to discern whether it's make
invisible or teleport away?  Have you ever set your game back a number
of notches and found out that it was the third alternative?
